ter\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F56233%2F56233.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️【楽天トラベル公式】吉野温泉元湯の空室・宿泊プラン一覧 ≫\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">奈良・奈良公園・吉野山千本桜・洞川温泉旅行に関するよくある質問（FAQ）</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span> 世界遺産「吉野山（よしのやま）」の桜の見頃と千本桜の区分は？</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 標高差により下千本・中千本・上千本・奥千本と順に咲き上がり、例年4月上旬〜中旬にかけて山全体が約3万本の山桜でピンクに染まります。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span> 天川村「洞川温泉（どろがわおんせん）」の街並みと縁側文化とは？</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 大峯山への行者を迎えてきた宿場町で、木造三階建ての旅館が連なり、夕暮れには提灯が灯り縁側で涼むレトロな風景が広がります。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span> 洞川温泉の名水グルメ「名水とうふ」と「ごろごろ水」とは？</h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 名水百選に選ばれたミネラル豊富な湧水で作る豆腐は極上の滑らかさで、湯豆腐や冷奴、鮎の塩焼きが名物です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/nara/\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 奈良県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">奈良県・関連テーマの厳選おすすめ旅行ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900\">おすすめテーマ特集</h4>\n      \n    <a href=\"/posts/infinity-footbath-terrace-cafe-bar-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 東府や Resort＆Spa－Izu・赤倉温泉 赤倉観光ホテルなど楽天トラベル高評価の名宿を徹底比較\n    </a>\n  \n\n    <a href=\"/posts/mineral-mud-pack-beauty-skin-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 別府明礬温泉 岡本屋旅館・湯けむりとにごり湯の宿 霧島国際ホテルなど楽天トラベル高評価の名宿を徹底比較\n    </a>\n  \n\n    <a href=\"/posts/fuji-view-luxury-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 ふふ 河口湖・庭園と感動の宿 富士山温泉 ホテル鐘山苑 別墅然然など楽天トラベル高評価の名宿を徹底比較\n    </a>\n  \n\n    <a href=\"/posts/ise-lobster-abalone-seafood-gourmet-hotels-guide\" class=\"block p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-stone-200 text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700 transition\">\n      👉 南伊豆弓ヶ浜温泉 季一遊・鴨川館など楽天トラベル高評価の名宿を徹底比較\n    </a>\n  \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900\">奈良県・地域別特集</h4>\n      <a href=\"/posts/nara-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block p-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-50/70 hover:bg-amber-100/80 border border-amber-200 text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 transition\">🏨【奈良県】厳選ホテル・旅館特集を見る</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/hokkaido-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨【北海道】厳選ホテル10選ガイド</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/tokyo-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨【東京都】厳選ホテル10選ガイド</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/kyoto-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨【京都府】厳選ホテル10選ガイド</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/okinawa-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-orange-700\">🏨【沖縄県】厳選ホテル10選ガイド</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
